    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2863948101",
      "Source": "Glow Sticks generate light in a radius around them. Throw it and it will stick immediately to the location they first impact. This is infinitely throwable.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"荧光棒在其周围半径内产生光亮。投掷出去，它会立即粘在首次撞击的位置。它可以无限投掷。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
