    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2569312308",
      "Source": "When attached to a Chest Armor, the Glider Suit enables sailing through the air by double-tapping jump, while gaining speed by running and diving! This glider does not tick durability!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"当穿戴在胸甲上时，滑翔翼可通过双击跳跃在空中滑翔，通过奔跑和俯冲获得速度！这个滑翔翼不消耗耐久度！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
