    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2275181894",
      "Source": "Use this while falling to slow your fall. Jump while parachuting to deactivate it. This item is infinitely usable.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在坠落时使用以减缓下落速度。在降落伞状态下跳跃可解除。此物品可无限使用。","JA":""},
